# Keep the AlphaFold pLDDT maps out of the app image (preditr.dockerfile: COPY . /app).
# pLDDT is large and organism-specific; it ships in the per-organism reference images instead
# (references/build_reference_image.sh copies maps/<organism>/ through its own build context,
# which this file does not affect). The app reads it at runtime from PREDITR_REFERENCES_PATH.
# See references/docs/compose-reference-images.md.
maps/**/plddt.rds
